      "header_row_index_0based": 0,
      "hold": false,
      "hold_placeholder": null,
      "inline_tags": [],
      "jp": "今日は楽しかったね、ご主人様。\nあ。間違っちゃった。今日は、じゃなくて、\n今日も、だったね。",
      "jp_sha256": "8618f771a1f7e64fc83500f0eb5c9420f12a116239fe023fc061605ec799a380",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "ko": "오늘 즐거웠지, 주인님.\n아, 잘못 말했다. 오늘은이 아니라\n오늘도였지.",
      "message_index_0based": 1,
      "page_ctrl": "",
      "physical_line_1based": 10,
      "policy_sha256": "b5e7fd3e9caca00c1d40cf24880559ba1b79d6fec6b53af3006698eb26c34f6b",
